 a consensus around Likely D. Polymarket prices a Democratic win near 94 percent.\n\nDemocrat Marni von Wilpert has out-raised Republican Jim Desmond roughly five million dollars to three million, and outside groups have spent far more supporting her and attacking him. Headlines describe corruption-themed attack ads defining the race, and Desmond has faced scrutiny over a plane bought from donors. With no public general-election polls, the picture rests on fundamentals and expert ratings, keeping uncertainty wider than usual. The seat remains within Republican reach if the environment cools, but the weight of evidence favors von Wilpert.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9032, "margin": 8.24}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8754, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8706, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8931, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.865, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.8821, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8901, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9072, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.8986, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9177, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9073, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9094, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9095, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.8812, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.8803, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.8917, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.8965, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.8692, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9026, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.8988, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9236, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9049, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9303, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.8951, "margin": 9.